# A long paste (5000 characters or more) becomes a text file, put up at once, then sent with the message.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
wait 1000
tap 发消息
pasten 6000 长段落粘贴测试。
until 6000 字符
shot 1-card
gone 正在上传
shot 2-uploaded
type 附上一段长文字 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
until 附上一段长文字 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 3-sent
